WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.550
One of the biggest
advantages of

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.400
subterranean warfare is
if you are the one who's

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.190
built these facilities,
built these tunnels, you

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.500
automatically have the
advantage. You know the

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.130
terrain.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.370
The pyramid structure in
the image sits inside a

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.810
highly secure region of
China.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.660
So it's hard to say if
this is a mysterious

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:26.140
ancient tomb or an
apocalypse pyramid packed

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.160
with nukes.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.840
It could take years,
maybe even decades, to

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.900
find out what's actually
going on at this

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.040
mysterious Chinese
structure.

